Z||000004||Tigger||10-09-2001||08:25 AM||||A girl that lived next door to me had an escort wagon back when we were in high school.  What a dog...  uh, I mean the escort.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyway, you'd mash the gas from a stop and it seemed like it would take a full block to reach 25mph.  Woo Hoo!<P>So yeah, I think a 4spd SE could hold it's own against an escort.||||reg||7
Z||000005||sqoach||10-09-2001||01:04 PM||||I <I>lost</I> a race to an escort  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>Well, sorta. We didn't take off from a dead stop or anything. I woulda killed him then. I was going about 30-35 and had it in fourth. (had a 2.5L 5spd) I saw him coming from behind and didn't kick it down to 3rd, so needless to say, I wasn't picking up speed very fast, and he slowly passed me. (yes, he know we were racing. got over 50 in a 45) Just make sure you know what you're doing, and it should be no prob.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">            <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*SOLD*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC</FONT>||||reg||11
Z||000006||IwannaIRM||10-09-2001||02:25 PM||||Way back when, I raced a fellow National Guardsman in my 84 Fiero SE against his 86 Escort GT.  I won!<P>Pis#ed him off that he lost.  It was a sweet win back then.  I was young my car aging, his car was new and he was aging.  You get the picture.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"> <B>Attitude baby, attitude!</B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>------------------<BR>AIM - SWags2933<P>84 Fiero SE (being modified)<BR>88 Formula||||reg||1
Z||000007||KRMFiero||10-09-2001||09:47 PM||||I have owned a 86 Escort and a 88 Escort GT... both standards<P>I have owned a few fieros, if your 84 is Automatic i can pretty much garantee the escort will win in the drag if the escort 5 speed.. they are faster then u think - not gog top end speed though.<BR>86 Escort was a 1.8L l4 with around 80 hp +/- a few, I belive a 6500rpm redline<BR>(Just so u know GT escorts are 1.8 FI HO 115hp, and they move pretty good)<P>Kyle<BR>||||reg||1
